# Wonky Windmill: a stone tower under a thatch cap with four sails, behind the mill house.
# Hand-placed by the landmark pass on the room's blocked back band and what lies behind it,
# so it never stands on a tile a knight walks or hides the floor from the camera.

# the tower, its gallery and thatch cap
frustum-12 stone   at 128 0 0 size 32 60 32 id lm-mill-tower
cylinder-12 wood    at 128 34 0 size 32 3 32
cone-10 thatch  at 128 60 0 size 30 22 30 id lm-mill-cap
box    door    at 128 0 15.9 size 10 18 1
# the hub and four sails (arms and their lattice blades), facing the room
box    metal   at 128 44 14.9 size 8 8 3
box    wood    at 128 46.5 14 size 72 3 2 id lm-sail-arm-h
box    wood    at 128 12 14 size 3 72 2 id lm-sail-arm-v
box    thatch  at 152 49.5 14 size 24 10 1.2
box    thatch  at 120.25 60 14 size 12.5 24 1.2
box    thatch  at 104 36.5 14 size 24 10 1.2
box    thatch  at 135.75 12 14 size 12.5 24 1.2
